102	```ts
103	import type { PersonaBuildPlugin, ValidationResult } from '@mistralys/persona-builder';
104	
105	const requiredFieldsPlugin: PersonaBuildPlugin = {
106	  name: 'required-fields',
107	
108	  onValidate(persona): ValidationResult[] {
109	    const errors: ValidationResult[] = [];
110	    if (!persona.description) {
111	      errors.push({ severity: 'error', message: `${persona.name}: missing "description" field` });
112	    }
113	    if (!persona.version) {
114	      errors.push({ severity: 'warning', message: `${persona.name}: missing "version" field` });
115	    }
116	    return errors;
117	  },
118	};
119	```
120	
121	### Reading `personaMode` in a plugin
122	
123	`personaMode` is a free-form string set per suite in `SuiteConfig`. The library does not
124	interpret it — it is your plugin's signal to change behaviour based on which suite is
125	being built.
126	
127	```ts
128	import type { PersonaBuildPlugin } from '@mistralys/persona-builder';
129	
130	const modeAwarePlugin: PersonaBuildPlugin = {
131	  name: 'mode-aware',
132	
133	  onSuiteInit(suite) {
134	    // Called once per suite before any persona is built.
135	    // suite.personaMode is whatever was set in SuiteConfig.personaMode.
136	    if (suite.personaMode === 'numbered') {
137	      console.log('Building numbered workflow suite');
138	    }
139	  },
140	
141	  onBuildContext(context, persona, suite) {
142	    if (suite.personaMode === 'numbered') {
143	      // Inject a mode-specific variable only for numbered suites
144	      return { ...context, workflow_mode: 'numbered' };
145	    }
146	    return context;
147	  },
148	};
149	```
150	
151	Known mode values are entirely plugin-defined. The library imposes no constraints on the
152	string value — you choose the convention that suits your project.
153	
154	---
155	
156	## Ledger Plugin — Migrated
157	
158	> **Moved in v2.0.0** — The ledger plugin has been removed from this library and migrated to the
159	> [ai-insights-dev](https://github.com/mistralys/ai-insights-dev) workspace as a local CommonJS
160	> module at `personas/plugins/ledger/`. The `@mistralys/persona-builder/plugins/ledger` sub-path
161	> export no longer exists. See the ai-insights-dev repository for current ledger plugin source and
162	> documentation.
